# version_whitelist.conf — IP/host exemptions for the VERSION module
#
# Copy to datadir as version_whitelist.conf (same directory as deny_version.conf).
# Reloaded on: start, or "<botnick> rehash".
#
# One entry per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Literal forms (recommended for a friend's IP):
#   203.0.113.10
#   2001:db8::42
#   *@203.0.113.10
#   friend.example.net
#
# Match is against the client's host, cloaked host if present in cache, and
# real client IP from the P10 N-line when available. Matching is case-insensitive.
#
# Advanced: Perl regex (prefix with re:)
#   re:\.trusted-isp\.example$
#   re:^203\.0\.113\.
#
# Example (replace with the real IP — do not commit secrets/IPs if the repo is public):
# 203.0.113.10
